{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"37240f583e914ba42181e29fd451e0e08b4e7c4e2af1563522da6f6a9285f631","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":9,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["未來的君王"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["但那些受過痛苦的人必不再遇見黑暗。從前，耶和華使西布倫人和拿弗他利人住的地方受人藐視，日後必使這些地方，即約旦河東、沿海一帶、外族人居住的加利利得到榮耀。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"走在黑暗中的人必看見大光，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"活在死蔭之地的人必被光照亮。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華啊，你必使以色列成為大國，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他們喜氣洋洋。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必在你面前歡喜快樂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像豐收時那樣歡喜，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如同瓜分戰利品時那樣快樂。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為你必折斷他們負的重軛和欺壓者的棍棒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像昔日你毀滅米甸人一樣；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"勇士爭戰穿的靴子和染血的戰袍都要被扔進火裡燒掉。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為必有一個嬰兒為我們誕生，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有一個兒子要賜給我們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂肩頭必擔負王權。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂被稱為奇妙的策士、大能的上帝、永存的父、和平的君。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂的國必長治久安。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必坐在大衛的寶座上以公平和公義治國興邦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使國家永固。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"萬軍之耶和華必熱切地成就此事。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶和華要審判以色列"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"主已出言審判雅各家，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的審判必臨到以色列，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法蓮和撒瑪利亞的居民都知道。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們驕傲自大地說：","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「磚牆倒塌了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們鑿石重建；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"桑樹砍倒了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們換種香柏樹。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此耶和華必興起利汛的仇敵，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"驅使敵人來攻擊他們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"東有亞蘭人，西有非利士人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必吞噬以色列。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雖然如此，耶和華的怒氣還沒有止息，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂降罰的手仍沒有收回。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"但百姓沒有歸向擊打他們的主，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不尋求萬軍之耶和華。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，耶和華要在一日之間剷除以色列的頭和尾，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"棕樹枝和蘆葦。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"頭是指他們的長老和首領，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"尾是指教人虛謊之事的假先知。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這些帶領者使百姓步入歧途、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"走向滅亡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們都目無上帝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"行事邪惡，口出妄語。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以，主不喜歡他們的青年，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不憐憫他們的孤兒寡婦。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雖然如此，耶和華的怒氣還沒有止息，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂降罰的手仍沒有收回。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"邪惡像燃燒的火焰，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"焚毀荊棘和蒺藜，點燃密林，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"煙柱旋轉上騰。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"萬軍之耶和華的烈怒必如火燒焦大地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"百姓成為燒火的柴，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"弟兄彼此相煎。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們左搶右奪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"仍食不果腹，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"紛紛吃自己的骨肉","poem":1},{"noteId":4},{"text":"。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法蓮和瑪拿西自相殘殺，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又聯合起來攻打猶大。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雖然如此，耶和華的怒氣還沒有止息，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂降罰的手仍沒有收回。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"line_break"}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":4,"caller":"+","text":"「骨肉」或譯「臂膀的肉」。","reference":{"chapter":9,"verse":20}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/9.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/10.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/8.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":21}